<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-kriegman-xenobot-evolutionary-biobots> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Kriegman et al. (2020, 2021) Xenobot evolutionary biomechanics & kinematic self-replication (Xenopus laevis (African clawed frog blastula ectoderm & cardiac progenitor biobots))",
        "Kriegman et al. (2020, 2021) Xenobot evolutionary biomechanics & kinematic self-replication faithfully reproduces Xenopus laevis (African clawed frog blastula ectoderm & cardiac progenitor biobots) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/kriegman-xenobot-evolutionary-biobots-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/kriegman-xenobot-evolutionary-biobots-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/kriegman-xenobot-evolutionary-biobots-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2020-kriegman-xenobot-evolutionary-biobots.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Xenopus laevis (African clawed frog blastula ectoderm & cardiac progenitor biobots) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 59.2/100, audit 2026-10-19-xenobot-evolutionary-biobots-audit) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2020-kriegman-xenobot-evolutionary-biobots.py> ;
    schema:about "Xenopus laevis (African clawed frog blastula ectoderm & cardiac progenitor biobots)" ;
